OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells
OL,6,Fin the south at first otherwise mostly
OL,7,Fcloudy with scattered showers in the
OL,8,Fnorth and west for a time in the late
OL,9,Fevening. Clear spells and frosty later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FMost places dry with bright
OL,12,For sunny spells and a frosty start to
OL,13,Fthe morning. Cloudy with a few showers
OL,14,Fin the west.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FLess
OL,17,Fcold from Friday. Mostly cloudy, dry
OL,18,FFriday and Saturday, an odd shower in
OL,19,Fthe far west. Rain in the north at
OL,20,Ffirst Sunday, otherwise mostly cloudy
OL,21,Fbut dry.
